#
#   ./so-console                  # interactive console (numbered menu)
#   ./so-console status|install|probe 497|gate|routes switch tw|logs soco ...
#
# Nothing here is host-specific: every path/dir comes from /etc/so/console.conf
# (created by `install`), so the same file runs on any Debian x86_64 / aarch64 box.
